            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.138</h2><ul><li>Keeps the pairing QR code and setup JSON synchronized with the current Companion fields and bridge configuration.</li><li>Includes the configured HTTPS tunnel URL immediately after launch without requiring the user to focus or edit its field.</li><li>Prevents navigation and background diagnostics from replacing the current pairing payload with stale rendered state.</li></ul>
]]></description>
